\">تفاعلی تفسیر میں کھولیں (مکمل متون)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ur/ayah/54-43.html\">پچھلی آیت (54:43)</a><a href=\"/ur/ayah/54-47.html\">اگلی آیت (54:47)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>جامع تفسیر الشیخین · <a href=\"/ur/\">صفحۂ اول</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">منصوبے کے بارے میں</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">رازداری اور شرائط</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/54-47.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ur\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>تفسیر القمر 54:47 — ابن تیمیہ اور ابن القیم کے کلام میں</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"بیشک گناه گار گمراہی میں اور عذاب میں ہیں.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/54-47.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" 